---
---

<section class="section delivers">
  <div class="container">
    <div data-reveal>
      <h2>What CHIME Delivers</h2>
      <h3 class="delivers__sub">Improving Volume Output</h3>
      <p>
        Work force productivity holds the key to improving regulated volumes output. CHIME focuses
        on both engineering and in-field productivity to deliver higher volumes. CHIME goes beyond
        scheduling and work management to enable faster work execution, maximising volumes per site
        visit and reducing the engineering time needed to manage.
      </p>
      <p>
        No other application has been designed to specifically target work productivity. CHIME
        stands apart as the only application built with Network Operators for Network Operators
      </p>

      <h3 class="delivers__functionality-heading">
        CHIME Equips You with All This Essential Functionality to Drive Productivity and Efficiency.
      </h3>
    </div>

    <div class="delivers__infographics" data-reveal>
      <div class="delivers__figure">
        <img
          src="/images/infographic-1.png"
          alt="CHIME functionality overview, part one"
          width="600"
          height="800"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          onerror="this.style.display='none'; this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex';"
        />
        <div class="delivers__figure-fallback">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2" />
            <path d="M3 15 L9 10 L13 14 L21 7" />
            <circle cx="8" cy="8" r="1.4" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
          </svg>
          <span>Infographic artwork pending</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="delivers__figure">
        <img
          src="/images/infographic-2.png"
          alt="CHIME functionality overview, part two"
          width="600"
          height="800"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          onerror="this.style.display='none'; this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex';"
        />
        <div class="delivers__figure-fallback">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2" />
            <path d="M3 15 L9 10 L13 14 L21 7" />
            <circle cx="8" cy="8" r="1.4" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
          </svg>
          <span>Infographic artwork pending</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .delivers h2 {
    font-size: 2.125rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .delivers__sub {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-blue-deep);
  }

  .delivers p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    max-width: 56rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-grey-600);
  }

  .delivers__functionality-heading {
    margin-top: var(--space-gutter);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    max-width: 44rem;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .delivers__infographics {
    margin-top: var(--space-gutter);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-gutter);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .delivers__infographics {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .delivers__figure {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--color-grey-100), #dce9f2 55%, #c9e4f0);
  }

  .delivers__figure img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .delivers__figure-fallback {
    display: none;
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-grey-600);
  }

  .delivers__figure-fallback svg {
    width: 2.5rem;
    height: 2.5rem;
  }

  .delivers__figure-fallback span {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
</style>
